WEBVTT

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:01.000
the way we're taught to live
has got to change.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.216
I learned this the hard way.

00:02:04.240 --> 00:02:06.456
I was born not on
the wrong side of the tracks,

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:08.455
but on the wrong side of a whole river,

00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:11.656
the Trinity, down in Oak Cliff, Texas.

00:02:11.680 --> 00:02:14.096
I was raised there
in part by my grandmother

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.416
who worked as a domestic,

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.536
and by my sister,

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:21.096
who adopted me
a few years after our mother,

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.096
who struggled with mental illness,

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.936
disappeared.

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:26.976
And it was that disappearance,

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.496
that began when I was 13
and lasted for five years,